<title>UK: Wagon CEO and chairman leave company.</title>
<headline>Wagon CEO and chairman leave company.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wagon Industrial Holdings Plc said on Friday that chairman Paul Taylor is retiring and that chief executive John Hudson is resigning.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that David Kendall will take over as chairman on January 6. He is currently chairman of Blagden Industries Plc, Ruberoid Plc and Whitecroft Plc.</p>
<p>Wagon, which manufactures storage products and retail systems, said that a replacement for Hudson will be initiated soon.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
